[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10620.23, "timestamp": "02:57:00", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10623.59, "timestamp": "02:57:03", "text": "我的天啊。 细胞感觉。 好了，全是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10627.67, "timestamp": "02:57:07", "text": "馅料。 月亮的力量有什么作用？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10629.91, "timestamp": "02:57:09", "text": "哦，那很好。 就像随着时间的推移，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10637.349, "timestamp": "02:57:17", "text": "回合数的增加，你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10641.75, "timestamp": "02:57:21", "text": "伤害也会慢慢地越来越大。 就像要堆叠起来一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10643.429, "timestamp": "02:57:23", "text": "这就是为什么我一开始就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10645.59, "timestamp": "02:57:25", "text": "拥有一个月亮之力，并且能够造成如此大的伤害，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10648.07, "timestamp": "02:57:28", "text": "这很好。 如果你在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10650.07, "timestamp": "02:57:30", "text": "游戏后期才拿到它，那就不好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10651.67, "timestamp": "02:57:31", "text": "。 你大概会在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10654.63, "timestamp": "02:57:34", "text": "第五轮就拿到它。 这不太好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10656.389, "timestamp": "02:57:36", "text": "哦，"}]